1
00:00:00,028 --> 00:00:00,867
This Father's Day
这个父亲节

2
00:00:00,868 --> 00:00:03,031
I prepared a special gift for my dad
我给我爸爸准备了一份特别的礼物

3
00:00:03,148 --> 00:00:06,310
I chose a nice tie because he wears one to work every day
我选了一条好看的领带因为他每天上班都戴一条

4
00:00:06,407 --> 00:00:07,147
In the morning
在早上。

5
00:00:07,147 --> 00:00:08,160
I gave him the gift
我把礼物给了他

6
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:10,551
and he was very happy and hugged me
他很高兴，拥抱了我

7
00:00:10,667 --> 00:00:12,951
We had breakfast together and then went to the park
我们一起吃了早餐然后去了公园

8
00:00:13,188 --> 00:00:16,306
Dad took me to play on the slides and swings
爸爸带我玩滑梯和秋千

9
00:00:16,307 --> 00:00:17,786
We had a lot of fun that day
那天我们玩得很开心

10
00:00:17,788 --> 00:00:20,510
Seeing my dad so happy made me happy too
看到我爸爸这么开心我也很开心

11
00:00:20,867 --> 00:00:23,190
Father's Day is a great chance to show love
父亲节是一个表达爱意的好机会

12
00:00:23,468 --> 00:00:25,150
I love my dad very much
我很爱我爸爸

